{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同門弟杜賜、居士林超裴，捐貲助刻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信士余及人、林符五、滋謙、陳伯陞、明開等捐貲助刻。"}
