{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和千巖長禪師韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念爾公求"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有大士在上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "霜劍西堂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若海首座請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "座山知幻爾首座請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光澤常山霜劍首座再請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬善天懷本西堂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白雲默山演西堂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雪英中侍者請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石憨西堂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徹空西堂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤山心澄、印人二西堂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壽山慧嚴西堂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "龍華自牧\n上座請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲峰監院古請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遯庵常住請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "林定于居士求"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居士求"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師遇生命，隨買隨放，至囊空解衣酬之。人見其\n度生之切，皆禮為師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師遇童子，或錢或果與之，令其念佛。童後見師\n來，皆高聲稱念，遠近成風。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有外道問：「念佛有何靈驗？」師云：「能起\n死回生。」外云：「果如是，我鄰家有人新故，可往救之。」師至其家，令人同念。至炷香，亡者果醒，人皆返邪皈正。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時疫氣盛行，師懺之即愈。有一家皆病，適暑氣蒸人。師至，教合\n家高聲念佛，扇我體冷，病即愈矣。果如師言，皆起身禮謝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有士晚生一子，發痘而亡。求救於師，師禱於路。至家，其兒復甦，鄉人始知奉法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "緇素參叩，師隨宜講論，日夜不輟。人皆如貧得寶，如暗得燈矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧求"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲峰作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自經而寂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曹山、蓮山、西岩、彌山、東坡、龍淵、塔菴仝捐貲助刻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在蘇州鄧蔚山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在興化蓮山"}
